* Rotten fruit (2 25 149; owner, 2026-11-21: "given that rotten fruit
* spreads disease, should we consider whether the fruits from the plants we
* made should have a rotten state--and sprite set?"). Pictures zfrr
* (art/rottenfruit.py): kind * 2 (the sea's fruits from 4), rotten then
* collapsed. OV00 is the fruit it was, OV03 its bush's look (not OV02, which
* would make a volcanic one the healing fruit to the mind). It lies for five
* steps of 900 ticks (about seven and a half minutes), giving the room one
* organic nutrient a step, as the game's own fruit gives five when it rots:
* the soil is fed, and the germs that live in rotting food. Then it is gone,
* and now and then a seedling stands where it lay.
scrp 2 25 149 9
  addv ov01 1
  addv ontr 1
  doif ov01 eq 3 pose 1 endi
  doif ov01 ge 5
    rndv var0 0 4
    doif var0 eq 0
      setv var1 0 enum 2 4 141 addv var1 1 next
      setv var2 0 setv rnge 200 esee 2 4 141 addv var2 1 next
      doif var1 lt 36
        * (nor in the dead-end pocket at the east end of the lava
        * corridor, room 167: a bush there drew hungry creatures into a
        * corner with one way out; owner, 2026-11-12)
        doif posl gt 8030
          doif posb gt 2100
            doif posb lt 2260 setv var2 1 endi
          endi
        endi
        * (never on a built platform: decks and ledges get potted bushes only)
        doif posl gt 7100
          doif posl lt 7700
            doif posb gt 850
              doif posb lt 915 setv var2 1 endi
            endi
          endi
        endi
        * (nor in the grendel egg chamber, nor on the long platform by
        * the upper-east lift; owner, 2026-11-09)
        doif posl gt 6900
          doif posl lt 7230
            doif posb gt 1150
              doif posb lt 1360 setv var2 1 endi
            endi
          endi
        endi
        doif posl gt 7220
          doif posl lt 7940
            doif posb gt 1290
              doif posb lt 1365 setv var2 1 endi
            endi
          endi
        endi
        doif posl gt 4800
          doif posl lt 5700
            doif posb gt 2230
              doif posb lt 2310 setv var2 1 endi
            endi
          endi
        endi
        doif posl gt 7950
          doif posl lt 8400
            doif posb gt 1250
              doif posb lt 1310 setv var2 1 endi
            endi
            doif posb gt 1790
              doif posb lt 1850 setv var2 1 endi
            endi
          endi
        endi
        * (nor on the water's surface: a fruit floating on the sea, with
        * a sea room's top near its base (the room starts about 30 px
        * above the waterline drawn), sprouts nothing; owner,
        * 2026-11-18, a bush had grown on the sea by the boats)
        setv var7 posl addv var7 posr divv var7 2
        setv var6 0
        reps 400
          doif room var6 4 eq 2
            doif room var6 0 le var7
              doif room var6 2 ge var7
                setv var8 room var6 1 subv var8 posb
                doif var8 gt -45
                  doif var8 lt 12 setv var2 1 endi
                endi
              endi
            endi
          endi
          addv var6 1
        repe
        * (nor in a lift's shaft, between 250 px above its top stop and
        * its bottom stop, judged by the fruit's middle: a bush grew between
        * the cage lift's cables at its middle stop, in the cabin's way;
        * owner, 2026-11-19. The lifts' spans and stops are the world's.)
        setv var3 posl addv var3 posr divv var3 2
        doif var3 ge 1534 doif var3 le 1637 doif posb ge 89 doif posb le 971 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 1546 doif var3 le 1649 doif posb ge 1245 doif posb le 2153 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 2334 doif var3 le 2458 doif posb ge 715 doif posb le 1705 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 3188 doif var3 le 3312 doif posb ge 1034 doif posb le 2000 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 3526 doif var3 le 3650 doif posb ge 1294 doif posb le 2265 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 4172 doif var3 le 4275 doif posb ge 342 doif posb le 1165 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 4549 doif var3 le 4673 doif posb ge 1826 doif posb le 2259 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 5116 doif var3 le 5240 doif posb ge 1364 doif posb le 1862 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 5705 doif var3 le 5829 doif posb ge 1607 doif posb le 2259 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 5759 doif var3 le 5862 doif posb ge 211 doif posb le 1179 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 2220 doif var3 le 2324 doif posb ge 1898 doif posb le 2325 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 302 doif var3 le 406 doif posb ge 1264 doif posb le 1845 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 60 doif var3 le 164 doif posb ge 784 doif posb le 1507 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 7525 doif var3 le 7629 doif posb ge 442 doif posb le 2156 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 8118 doif var3 le 8222 doif posb ge 1053 doif posb le 1849 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var3 ge 1320 doif var3 le 1479 doif posb ge 1049 doif posb le 1845 setv var2 1 endi endi endi endi
        doif var2 eq 0
          setv var3 posl subv var3 70 setv var4 posb subv var4 107
          setv var5 ov03
          doif posl gt 6400
            doif posb gt 1780 setv var5 2 endi
          endi
          * (in the desert above the incubator: the desert look)
          doif posl gt 4300
            doif posl lt 5735
              doif posb lt 650 setv var5 4 endi
            endi
          endi
          * (under water: kelp; a sea fruit ashore: mossy)
          doif rtyp eq 2
            setv var5 5
          else
            doif var5 eq 5 setv var5 0 endi
          endi
          inst
          doif var5 eq 0 new: simp zfbs 12 0 -10 0 endi
          doif var5 eq 1 new: simp zfbm 12 0 -10 0 endi
          doif var5 eq 2 new: simp zfbv 12 0 -10 0 endi
          doif var5 eq 3 new: simp zfbw 12 0 -10 0 endi
          doif var5 eq 4 new: simp zfbd 12 0 -10 0 endi
          doif var5 eq 5 new: simp zfbk 12 0 -10 0 endi
          setv cls2 2 4 141 setv attr 0 setv rnge 150
          setv ov00 0 setv ov01 0 setv ov02 var5 setv ov03 2 setv ov04 -10 setv ov99 7461
          mvto var3 var4 pose sean tick 250
          slow
        endi
      endi
    endi
    kill ownr
  endi
endm
* Eating one: it feeds nothing, and the belly hurts at once (18, Pain
* Increase) so it is learned; it may also bring the illness that lives in
* rotting food (Disease::ateRotten).
scrp 2 25 149 12
  snde chwp
  stim writ from 0 255 0 0 18 120 19 60 0 0 0 0
  kill ownr
endm

* When a falling fruit hits the floor (event 6, collision) it lies on its
* side: pictures 4 and 5. The round sunplum's are the same as upright.
scrp 2 25 141 6
  doif pose eq 2 pose 4 endi
  doif pose eq 3 pose 5 endi
endm
scrp 2 25 142 6
  doif pose eq 2 pose 4 endi
  doif pose eq 3 pose 5 endi
endm
scrp 2 25 143 6
  doif pose eq 2 pose 4 endi
  doif pose eq 3 pose 5 endi
endm
scrp 2 25 144 6
  doif pose eq 2 pose 4 endi
  doif pose eq 3 pose 5 endi
endm

* The fruits. Eating one gives its own mix (chemicals: 36 pleasure-need
* decrease, 37 hunger decrease, 70 glucose, 73 starch, 74 fat, 79 protein,
* 97 water, 150 vitamin E, 151 vitamin C); an overripe one gives about
* half. A volcanic bush's fruit (OV02 2) also gives EDTA (157):
* heavy metals (140) are made from radiation over 48 and barely decay, and
* EDTA, which nothing else in the world gives, is all that removes them,
* one for one; it does nothing else in the standard genomes (owner,
* 2026-11-21: "should the food growing in the volcano provide EDTA?"). It
* also gives Pain Decrease (35), 60 ripe and 30 overripe: heavy metals are
* felt as pain (Exposure.cpp), and the relief has to be felt at once for a
* poisoned creature to learn the place (12 game days in a Home copy without
* it: no pull toward the volcano at all). After a while a fruit goes overripe, and later rots away.
* Spring: dewberries, light and juicy. (Until 2026-11-22 the spring and summer
* fruits gave only glucose, 60 and 90, where a fruit of the game gives 100
* starch, each worth 12: hatchlings ate dozens and starved; reported by
* players. Now about 1,500 and 1,800 (protein aside), still the lightest: autumn
* about 3,100, winter 5,900.)
scrp 2 25 141 12
  snde chwp
  * ripe (pictures 2 and 4) gives the full mix
  setv var0 pose doif var0 gt 3 subv var0 2 endi
  doif var0 le 2
    stim writ from 30 255 0 0 37 60 70 60 97 60 151 50
    stim writ from 0 255 0 0 73 90 74 6 79 10 0 0
  else
    stim writ from 30 255 0 0 37 30 70 30 97 30 151 20
    stim writ from 0 255 0 0 73 45 74 3 79 5 0 0
  endi
  * a volcanic bush's fruit also gives EDTA (157), the only cure for heavy
  * metals, which radiation by the volcano builds up, and soothes their pain
  * at once (35, Pain Decrease) so the place where it was eaten is felt to
  * help (owner, 2026-11-21)
  doif ov02 eq 2
    doif var0 le 2
      stim writ from 0 255 0 0 157 60 35 60 0 0 0 0
    else
      stim writ from 0 255 0 0 157 30 35 30 0 0 0 0
    endi
  endi
  kill ownr
endm
* Summer: sunplums, sweet.
