      stim writ from 0 255 0 0 157 60 35 60 0 0 0 0
    else
      stim writ from 0 255 0 0 157 30 35 30 0 0 0 0
    endi
  endi
  kill ownr
endm

* Berry shrubs (2 4 142; owner, 2026-11-09). The red berries (the game's
* own, 2 25 11) used to come from hidden patches (after JayD's), with
* nothing to show where, and with no timer of their own they never rotted:
* carried off, they lay about for good, and some landed inside the rock by
* the glass dome. Now each place has a shrub of our own (berrybush.py: zbrd
* in the dome's garden, zbrp potted on the bamboo walkway in the east caves; one
* picture per season). Every 60 seconds it takes the season's picture and,
* if fewer than five berries are near, hangs one more in its crown. The
* berries carry the game's own timer script (tick 300): they hang, fall
* (at once in spring and summer, after a few minutes in autumn and
* winter) and rot about ten minutes later unless a creature is carrying
* one.
scrp 2 4 142 9
  pose sean
  setv var0 0
  esee 2 25 11 addv var0 1 next
  doif var0 lt 5
    setv var2 posl rndv var3 18 66 addv var2 var3
