* The upper-east deck's bush moves to the cave under the east dock (owner,
* 2026-11-18: deck-bush-spots.png, spot A, moved left past the guitar). On
* the deck (room 145, potted at 7604/779; 7582/779 before ledge.cos moves
* it) it fed nobody: the deck is a dead end reached only by a lift that
* mostly waits at its bottom stop, and no creature stood there in 56
* samples while about 3 of its fruit lay ripe. In the cave (room 14, floor
* 892 on the planks) hungry creatures wait with no food. The stalactites
* leave no room for the full bush, so it becomes the compact one in a pot
* (zfqw, warm rock, OV07 = 1), its right edge 3 px left of the guitar (2 13
* 17, x 6063-6135) and clear of the submarine's stop at the cave's east
* end. Stage, age and picture are kept; the fruit still on it go (their
* places were for the full crown).
