* The bush that seeded itself in the dead-end pocket at the east end of the
* lava corridor (room 167, x 8040-8240; its east side is solid and the only
* way out is west) drew hungry creatures into the corner, where they stayed
* (owner, 2026-11-12: "move it"). It moves west along the corridor to the
* lava-rock floor at x 6995-7151 (floor y ~2176), beside the bush by the
* volcano's mouth (6822-6978) and clear of the big pot east of it (from
* x ~7158, which hid its corner at 7100); the two on the machine ledge
* (7640, 7860) are further east;
* the fruit still on it goes with it. Only a bush found in the pocket moves,
* so this is safe to repeat; no new one sprouts there (above).
enum 2 4 141
